{"id":"73eebc6c2f743f18","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-model-omitting-type.md","title":"ZFC Model Omitting Type","display":"df-zfc-model-omitting-type — ZFC Model Omitting Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-omitting-type","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-omitting-type"],"display":"df-zfc-model-omitting-type — ZFC Model Omitting Type","depends_on":["[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-omitting-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-omitting-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-omitting-type — ZFC Model Omitting Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,A,B,T,L,n\\in V\">\\(p,A,B,T,L,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (carrier projection; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S(p,A,B,T,L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(A,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(A,\\bar a,p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S(p,A,B,T,L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(A,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(A,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,B,T,L,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(A)^n\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{RealizesType}_S(A,\\bar a,p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingType}_S(p,A,L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists B,T\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S(p,A,B,T,L,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingType}_S(p,A,L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists B,T\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcModelOmittingTypeData}_S(p,A,B,T,L,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The six-place predicate exposes the arity, parameter set, and theory.  It also requires the candidate structure to model that theory and to contain the named parameters.</li>\n<li>Omission is stated through the canonical realization predicate, whose named expansion interprets parameter constants; a raw expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\">\\(A\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\)</span> cannot do that by itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df